	REJECTED "a sixth operation answering the table: one operation more for every adapter, where"
		+ "the probe already declares what an adapter supports"
	REJECTED "the core importing the reasoning table of the Claude Code adapter: the guard of"
		+ "tests/guards refuses a static import of brigade.adapters from outside it"
