DECISION TheSupportedClientsTableIsGeneratedFromTheProbes
	TITLE "the supported-clients table has one row per client adapter and one column per"
		+ "capability, generated by brigade adapter matrix from the probes, and the adapters of the"
		+ "test suite live in a package of their own"
	STATUS active
	DESC "the capabilities are launch, result, resume, transcripts, actions, step count, tool"
		+ "grants and reset hour, the operations and features a probe declares; a cell reads full,"
		+ "fallback or absent, absent for launch or result alone, which have no fallback"
	DESC "an adapter of the test suite is a module of brigade/adapters/test_clients, the fake"
